sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant B as E-stop button
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant All as All subsystems
  Note over B,All: Can happen at any moment, in any state.
  Op->>B: Press E-stop
  B->>S: ESTOP
  S->>All: CMD_ABORT (stop all actuators)
  All-->>S: STOPPED
  S->>Op: ALERT: E-stop active
  Note over S: Stack light turns red, so the operator sees it from across the roof
  Note over S: Position and step are no longer trusted.<br/>Robot does not resume the step.
  Op->>S: Manual reset
  Note over S: Supervisor returns to IDLE.<br/>Operator checks the robot and presses START again.
